<div class="desktop xypufxb"><div class="site-header-slot header-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Header /></div><div class="gradient-wrap x3mhyvo"><section class="hero xe4wmfc"><div class="padding xi9ijje fb"><div class="content xbnoz9m"><div class="head-content xhvkom8"><h1 class="xcrvchq">About Vocom</h1><p class="xrfba8c">One team behind fiber optic cable, enterprise AI, and global telecom services for customers worldwide.</p><div class="button-group xmsr4bh"><a class="button-primary xemwtuy" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xc4cgop">Get Started Today</p></a><a class="button-secondary xc3hwkb fb" href="/"><p class="xowcorr">Learn More</p></a></div></div><div class="under xj1meuj"><div class="video xg7c5ze"><video class="video-fill" data-src="/assets/video/about-4b466c.mp4" data-autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="none" style="object-fit:cover;border-radius:20px;"></video></div></div></div></div></section><div class="partners xdzkk5w"><div class="xre1bfe"><div class="xrq1fly fb"></div><p class="x0jrv5i">Working with renowned, trusted, and leading enterprises</p><div class="xrq1fly fb"></div></div><div class="content xerscxd"><div class="logos x2udtsx"><div class="x1zycko"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/foxconn-logo-vocom-manufacturing-partner-0cda45.svg" alt="Foxconn logo, Vocom manufacturing partner" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="xk5l9or"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/supermicro-logo-vocom-hardware-partner-80142e.png" srcset="/assets/img/supermicro-logo-vocom-hardware-partner-80142e-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/supermicro-logo-vocom-hardware-partner-80142e.png 916w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="916" height="471" alt="Supermicro logo, Vocom hardware partner" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="x0ca6w1"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/serverfarm-logo-vocom-data-center-partner-68e9fe.svg" width="323" height="186" alt="Serverfarm logo, Vocom data center partner" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="bizlink xljmqbv"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/bizlink-logo-dd15dd.png" srcset="/assets/img/bizlink-logo-dd15dd-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/bizlink-logo-dd15dd.png 800w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="800" height="178" alt="BizLink logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="ats xm0p1kr"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/american-tech-supply-logo-98e806.png" srcset="/assets/img/american-tech-supply-logo-98e806-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/american-tech-supply-logo-98e806.png 711w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="711" height="104" alt="American Tech Supply logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="wesco xvfe9n3"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/wesco-logo-vocom-fiber-optic-supply-chain-partner-f1eba4.png" srcset="/assets/img/wesco-logo-vocom-fiber-optic-supply-chain-partner-f1eba4-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/wesco-logo-vocom-fiber-optic-supply-chain-partner-f1eba4.png 559w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="559" height="357" alt="Wesco logo, Vocom fiber optic supply chain partner" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="logo-optech"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/optech-logo-vocom-fiber-partner.png" width="233" height="80" alt="Optech logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div></div><div class="cards xi3thkw"><div class="h2 xlsdbpm"><div class="xf8fnkf"><h3 class="h3 xk0nmq5"><span class="xgvztuw">What </span><span class="xwgkw2u">We Do</span></h3><p class="xq9pbwc">Three disciplines, one mission: connect the world’s infrastructure.</p></div></div><div class="xznektj"><div class="x1ai5nw"><div class="xepe0jq"><div class="placeholder xlz1oqk"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-e21da2.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-e21da2-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-e21da2-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-e21da2-2048w.webp 2048w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-e21da2.jpg 5906w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="5906" height="3937" alt="Fiber optic cable spool for wholesale supply" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="p2 xamhnmh"><div class="xzzn7mt"><p class="x19p4ct">Fiber Optic Cable</p><p class="xagxmxk">Wholesale fiber optic cable, built to order and shipped worldwide, with 6 to 8 week standard lead times, up to 10 weeks for high-count or custom builds.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="xjlmtdo fb"><div class="material x2at3tf"><svg fill="rgb(166, 166, 166)" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 4-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z"/></svg></div></div><div class="xxlpcrb"><div class="xepe0jq"><div class="placeholder xlz1oqk"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-c516b5.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-c516b5-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-c516b5-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-c516b5.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1280" height="960" alt="Vocom AI enterprise tools for coaching, security, and supply chain" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="p2 xamhnmh"><div class="xzzn7mt"><p class="x19p4ct">Vocom AI</p><p class="xagxmxk">Enterprise AI across coaching, security, supply chain, and infrastructure, deployed without the wait.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="simple x3cvuhv"><div class="h2 xlsdbpm"><div class="xrebnwx"><h3 class="h3 x9df3um"><span class="xgvztuw">Why Choose </span><span class="xwgkw2u">Vocom</span><span class="xgvztuw">?</span></h3><p class="xq9pbwc">Three business lines, one standard of reliability.</p></div></div><div class="xw17gmf"><div class="xxk9dfa"><div class="placeholder x8acsca"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-d0cd87.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-d0cd87-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-d0cd87-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-spool-for-wholesale-supply-d0cd87.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1280" height="1920" alt="Fiber optic cable spool for wholesale supply" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="p2 xjowjde"><div class="xzzn7mt"><p class="x19p4ct">Fiber Optic Cable</p><p class="xagxmxk">Wholesale cable built to order, with 6 to 8 week standard lead times, up to 10 weeks for high-count or custom builds, and 2 to 3 week expedited air freight available.</p></div></div></div><div class="xxk9dfa"><div class="placeholder x8acsca"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-37368b.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-37368b-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-37368b-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-enterprise-tools-for-coaching-security-and-37368b.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1280" height="686" alt="Vocom AI enterprise tools for coaching, security, and supply chain" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="p2 xjowjde"><div class="xzzn7mt"><p class="x19p4ct">Vocom AI</p><p class="xagxmxk">No-code enterprise AI for coaching, security, supply chain, and infrastructure, deployed fast.</p></div></div></div><div class="xxk9dfa"><div class="placeholder x8acsca"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-2e764c.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-2e764c-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-2e764c-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-2e764c.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Vocom International global telecom network connectivity" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position:center bottom"/></div><div class="p2 xjowjde"><div class="xzzn7mt"><p class="x19p4ct">Vocom International</p><p class="xagxmxk">Global telecom services connecting enterprises across Asia, the Middle East, Europe, and beyond.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="x3cvuhv"><div class="xz29cxr"><p class="xvvra8p">Leadership</p><p class="xmdpnbp">Meet the Team</p></div><div class="xz93b46"><div class="xibsza2"><p class="xuzl10r">👤</p></div><div class="xcyalxx"><p class="xegkwiq">Victor Huang</p><p class="xyopmcw">Founder, Vocom International</p><p class="xsq5uaj">Victor Huang is the founder of Vocom International Telecommunications, Inc. He founded Vocom in Taipei in 1993, later expanding into Shenzhen and helping China Mobile, China Telecom, and China Unicom establish their early international operations. In 1998, Victor incorporated Vocom in the U.S., building it into a facilities-based carrier operating under license from the FCC’s International Bureau. Over more than three decades, he has worked with carrier partners on every continent except Antarctica, and Vocom today routes voice, data, fiber, mobile, and AI infrastructure for partner carriers across six continents, from wholesale IDD termination in 1998 to Supermicro AI compute today. Vocom remains entirely self-funded, running a modern facility staffed by an in-house team of telecom engineers trained to hold Quality of Service levels across every carrier route.</p></div></div><div class="xz93b46"><div class="kev-pic xraigvb"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/kevin-huang-founder-of-vocom-ai-183d62.png" srcset="/assets/img/kevin-huang-founder-of-vocom-ai-183d62-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/kevin-huang-founder-of-vocom-ai-183d62.png 800w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="800" height="800" alt="Kevin Huang, Founder of Vocom AI" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="xcyalxx"><p class="xegkwiq">Kevin Huang</p><p class="xyopmcw">Founder, Vocom AI</p><p class="xsq5uaj">Kevin Huang is the founder of Vocom AI, the AI-focused division of Vocom International. He leads go-to-market and product strategy across a full-stack deployment model spanning GPU and AI server infrastructure, data center integration, and custom AI software, giving customers one accountable partner instead of three disconnected vendors. His background spans product management and sales across telecom and AI infrastructure. He is fluent in English and Mandarin and holds a degree from the University of Southern California’s Marshall School of Business.</p></div></div></div><div class="4 xh2uytg"><div class="h2 xlsdbpm"><div class="xrebnwx"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Our Products</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">A closer look at what each business line delivers.</p></div></div><div class="xxky7hd"><div class="ximcc5x"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-installation-for-vocom-wholesale-supply-20d92f.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-installation-for-vocom-wholesale-supply-20d92f-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-installation-for-vocom-wholesale-supply-20d92f-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/fiber-optic-cable-installation-for-vocom-wholesale-supply-20d92f.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Fiber optic cable installation for Vocom wholesale supply" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="x8konua"><p class="xxzunjd">Fiber Optic Cable</p><p class="xvvww8p">Loose-tube, ribbon, ADSS, FTTH, and data-center cabling, built to order.</p></div></div></div><div class="xr52cna"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-ai-coach-hub-interface-for-always-on-d9638c.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-ai-coach-hub-interface-for-always-on-d9638c-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-coach-hub-interface-for-always-on-d9638c-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-coach-hub-interface-for-always-on-d9638c.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Vocom AI Coach Hub interface for always-on sales training" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xxzunjd">Vocom AI Coach Hub</p><p class="xvvww8p">Always-on AI training that helps teams talk smarter and close faster.</p></div></div></div><div class="xr52cna"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-ai-secure-video-security-and-access-control-d62989.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-ai-secure-video-security-and-access-control-d62989-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-secure-video-security-and-access-control-d62989-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-secure-video-security-and-access-control-d62989.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1281" alt="Vocom AI Secure video security and access control system" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position:center top"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xxzunjd">Vocom AI Secure</p><p class="xvvww8p">End-to-end video security and access control, powered by Coram AI.</p></div></div></div><div class="ximcc5x"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-afcb7a.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-afcb7a-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-afcb7a-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-global-telecom-network-connectivity-afcb7a.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Vocom International global telecom network connectivity" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xxzunjd">Vocom International</p><p class="xvvww8p">Global telecom services connecting enterprises across Asia, the Middle East, Europe, and beyond.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tsp-wrap"><TradeShowPhoto heading="On the Show Floor With Our Manufacturers" /></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="2 xctiiw2"><div class="xmrbb9j"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Proven Track Record</h3><p class="xlbo480">Our Impact in Numbers</p></div><div class="x0dn1mk"><div class="xkaqoyu"><h5 class="h5 xqsz0ci">1998</h5><p class="xqekyu8">Year founded, connecting telecom, data centers, and enterprise AI worldwide.</p></div><div class="xarzrlg"><h5 class="h5 xqsz0ci">25,000+ clients</h5><p class="xqekyu8">Enterprises across all major industries, served worldwide.</p></div></div></div><div class="simple xh2uytg"><div class="h2 xlsdbpm"><div class="xrebnwx"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">Your Questions, Answered</p></div></div><div class="xgjzcho"><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What services does VOCOM offer?">We provide bandwidth solutions, data center services, and interconnects for global communication.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What regions does VOCOM cover?">Our reach includes Asia, the Middle East, Europe, and North America.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How can I get started with VOCOM?">Simply reach out to us, and we will tailor a solution to meet your needs.</FaqItem></div></div></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="box xcezkca"><div class="xighwjk"><div class="h2 x6idugm"><div class="xptnlxu"><h3 class="h3 xgb5x2y">Ready to Work With Vocom?</h3><p class="subtext xqwkm7f">Fiber optic cable, enterprise AI, and global telecom services, one team, one standard.</p></div></div><a class="button-primary x6tj6kj" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Contact Us Now</p></a></div></div><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="Connecting the world through innovative telecommunications solutions." title="Quick Links" menu1="Home" menu2="VOCOM AI" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link1="/" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
